    "To scale this hustle, target non-competing businesses within the same geographical territory. If you optimize a high-end cosmetic dentist in the northern suburbs of your city, you cannot ethically work for their direct dental competitor across the street; however, you can immediately pitch the premium orthodontist, the pediatric clinic, the cosmetic dermatologist, and the high-end med-spa in the exact same commercial district.",
