    "The underlying cause of this support crisis is simple: most growing businesses have completely disorganized, outdated internal documentation. Their return policies are buried in five different email threads, their onboarding instructions are scattered across informal Slack messages, and their public FAQ page consists of four vague sentences written three years ago. What they need is a centralized, comprehensive Customer Knowledge Base and structured Interactive Help Center.",
